  "reason": "RNA PCA multiprofile with avgpool is currently the strongest result (accuracy 0.591, F1 0.573), while image-only ResNet singleprofile is weak (accuracy 0.208, F1 0.172). The key uncertainty is whether the image modality has useful signal under the same multiprofile avgpool setting that helped RNA, or whether the profile/aggregation gain is RNA-specific. config_011 tests image-only ResNet with multiprofile and avgpool, isolating the modality effect against config_002 and the profile/aggregation effect against config_010 without introducing fusion. This is the best next experiment because it establishes whether image features are worth combining before spending limited budget on multimodal fusion."
}

